{"title":"Friday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/927343418/0/marginalrevolution~Friday-assorted-links.html","date":1762533008000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://papers.ssrn.com/sol3/papers.cfm?abstract_id=5654692\" target=\"_blank\">Private rooms in a nursing home do not seem to help individuals</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. “We find that the height of Americans began to decline among those born around or before the early 1980s in parallel with the diminution in the rate of increase of life expectancy. The decline in adult height ranged from 0·68 ± 0.36 cm among white women to 1·97 ± 0.50 cm among Hispanic men and is statistically significant across all six demographic groups considered.”  Link <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2352827325001260?via%3Dihub\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://pubs.aeaweb.org/doi/pdfplus/10.1257/jep.20241417\" target=\"_blank\">Du Bois on economics</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nodumbideas.com/p/does-momentum-exist-in-prediction\" target=\"_blank\">Is there momentum in prediction markets?</a></p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/lukeburgis/status/1986481709341360235\" target=\"_blank\">Cluny Institute looking for a new partner</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/sama/status/1986514377470845007\" target=\"_blank\">Sam Altman on the role of government in AI</a>.</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/NikoMcCarty/status/1986501362730082464\" target=\"_blank\">Further discussion of Kosmos, the “AI scientist.”</a> And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/